### Create a new Caller ID Pool
POST http://localhost:8080/api/caller-id-pools
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Toshkent mijozlari puli",
  "strategy": "ROUND_ROBIN",
  "description": "Markaziy hudud uchun rotatsiya qilinadigan raqamlar",
  "initialPhones": [
    "+998712001122",
    "+998712001123"
  ]
}

### List Pools
GET http://localhost:8080/api/caller-id-pools
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Pool Detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/caller-id-pools/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Number to Pool
POST http://localhost:8080/api/caller-id-pools/1/numbers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phone": "+998712001124",
  "label": "Zaxira liniya"
}

### Put Number in Cooldown
POST http://localhost:8080/api/caller-id-pools/1/numbers/1/cooldown?hours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
